    Show quest "Long time nosee Sharine.. So is he doing alright? (Atlas unseals the letter) Oh no! The Spiritual Stone has been spreaded out this wide...Have to find a Pole of Purification ASAP..\n\nAccording to legend, a Pole of purification was divided by 3 pieces and given to 3 most sacred sprits in Temple of Water. And when the temple collapsed, it got diappeared since then..\n\nWhen Temple of Water collapsed, all 3 spirits died and there's no way to find the Pole of Purification.\n\nHowever according to oral tradition, the Spirit of Water reincarnate in human-being. If we find the reincarnated spirt of Water, we could find a Pole of Purification as well."
